-1974\"},\"bio\":{\"S\":\"An English actor known for his intense method acting and physical transformations for his roles.\"}}}},{\"PutRequest\":{\"Item\":{\"PK\":{\"S\":\"a#4324\"},\"SK\":{\"S\":\"a#4324\"},\"actorId\":{\"N\":\"4324\"},\"name\":{\"S\":\"Heath Ledger\"},\"dateOfBirth\":{\"S\":\"04-04-1979\"},\"bio\":{\"S\":\"An Australian actor and music video director, awarded a posthumous Academy Award for The Dark Knight.\"}}}},{\"PutRequest\":{\"Item\":{\"PK\":{\"S\":\"a#4325\"},\"SK\":{\"S\":\"a#4325\"},\"actorId\":{\"N\":\"4325\"},\"name\":{\"S\":\"Brad Pitt\"},\"dateOfBirth\":{\"S\":\"18-12-1963\"},\"bio\":{\"S\":\"An American actor and film producer, and the recipient of two Academy Awards.\"}}}},{\"PutRequest\":{\"Item\":{\"PK\":{\"S\":\"m#1234\"},\"SK\":{\"S\":\"a#4321\"},\"movieId\":{\"N\":\"1234\"},\"actorId\":{\"N\":\"4321\"},\"roleName\":{\"S\":\"Ellis Boyd \\\"Red\\\" Redding\"},\"roleDescription\":{\"S\":\"Serves as the film's narrator, deuteragonist, and emotional anchor. As a seasoned inmate serving a life sentence, Red is the \\\"man who can get things,\\\" a contraband smuggler who becomes the best friend and protector of Andy Dufresne.\"}}}},{\"PutRequest\":{\"Item\":{\"PK\":{\"S\":\"m#1234\"},\"SK\":{\"S\":\"a#4322\"},\"movieId\":{\"N\":\"1234\"},\"actorId\":{\"N\":\"4322\"},\"roleName\":{\"S\":\"Andy Dufresne\"},\"roleDescription\":{\"S\":\"A banker wrongly convicted of murdering his wife and her lover, who spends nearly two decades in Shawshank State Penitentiary.\"}}}},{\"PutRequest\":{\"Item\":{\"PK\":{\"S\":\"m#1235\"},\"SK\":{\"S\":\"a#4323\"},\"movieId\":{\"N\":\"1235\"},\"actorId\":{\"N\":\"4323\"},\"roleName\":{\"S\":\"Bruce Wayne / Batman\"},\"roleDescription\":{\"S\":\"Gotham's vigilante protector, who faces the Joker while questioning the cost of his crusade.\"}}}},{\"PutRequest\":{\"Item\":{\"PK\":{\"S\":\"m#1235\"},\"SK\":{\"S\":\"a#4324\"},\"movieId\":{\"N\":\"1235\"},\"actorId\":{\"N\":\"4324\"},\"roleName\":{\"S\":\"The Joker\"